["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\"\n data-hay=\"問題不由問號定義，而由尋求信息的行動定義 真正的問題由功能而非形式定義；提問是一種可以練習的權力，而今天 AI 給的答案大多還沒回答一個被認真提出的問題。 Philosophy Bites Philosophy Bites Lani Watson on the Power of Questions 提問 哲學 教育 AI 批判 溝通 Socrates information seeking act rhetorical question private questions and social questions answer oriented model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-phibites-真正的問題不是問號-而是尋求信息的行動/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://static.libsyn.com/p/assets/6/6/2/9/6629afb289ae5c80/philo_bites.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">16:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>問題不由問號定義，而由尋求信息的行動定義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的問題由功能而非形式定義；提問是一種可以練習的權力，而今天 AI 給的答案大多還沒回答一個被認真提出的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提問</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"20人團隊燒掉20億美元：AI改寫資本效率上限 AI 讓 20 人團隊能高效花掉 20 億美元，風險投資從零和轉向戰略控制點；前沿實驗室的融資優勢終會消退，應用層獲得更大價值。 The a16z Show a16z Martin Casado on Where the Value Is Going in AI AI投資 資本效率 模型競爭 開源 併購 創業公司 autocatalytic effects AI complete token path two-sided marketplace founder-market fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-22-a16z-小團隊吞下億級資本-ai-改寫投資邏輯/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.simplecastcdn.com/images/0d97354a-306b-45f5-bf26-a8d81eef47ec/ed2664df-9371-438e-8baf-dd2ee0fdde87/3000x3000/thea16zshow-podcastcoverart-3000x3000.jpg?aid=rss_feed\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0822</span></div>\n<h2>20人團隊燒掉20億美元：AI改寫資本效率上限</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 讓 20 人團隊能高效花掉 20 億美元，風險投資從零和轉